  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, it's the one at the corner again, the catch basin, it's packed solid with leaves and the water's just sitting there and coming back up into the driveway. [line breaks up] Sorry, I'm on speaker, I've got my hands full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you okay. Where are you calling from, Joel? Sorry, what's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 300 Memorial Boulevard, Easton's Beach side. The basin's right at the corner by the house. Ever since that nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, it hasn't drained."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so catch basin at the corner of 300 Memorial, clogged with leaves, water backing into the driveway. Got it. Is it getting into the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not the house, no, but it's running down toward my neighbor's garage. It's moving that way right now, I'm looking at it. I'm just walking a casserole over to a friend's door, so I'm standing out here, and I don't like how close it's getting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd worry me too. I'll put this in as a priority for the drain crew, flag the neighbor's garage so they know it's heading that direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Because if it gets in there, that's a mess, and it's only going to get worse if nobody clears it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Best number for you? I've got a note to call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight two. Good. I'll have somebody call you when it's been cleared, or if the crew needs anything else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, please call me back once it's done. I'd just like to know it's taken care of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks for calling, Joel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kevin."
    }
  ],
